@startuml F7.6-D01-listar-outbox
title F7.6-D01 — Listar eventos do Outbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "OutboxController" as Ctrl
participant "ListOutboxEventsUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: /admin/jobs
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /admin/outbox?status=FAILED
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT page + meta
note right of UC
  retry só FAILED/DEAD
end note
Postgres --> UC: eventos
UC --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Admin: tabela Outbox

@enduml
